{"id":"c664c247a9331632","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-open-set.md","title":"Open Set","display":"df-open-set — Open Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-open-set","aliases":["58-df-open-set","Open Set","58-df-zfc-top6-open-set"],"display":"df-open-set — Open Set","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-open-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-open-set</span><span>Open Set</span><span>58-df-zfc-top6-open-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-open-set — Open Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq X\">\\(U\\subseteq X\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\)</span>（拓扑，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Open}_S(U,X,\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Open}_S(U,X,\\mathcal T)\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Open}_S(U,X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\land U\\in\\mathcal T\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Open}_S(U,X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\land U\\in\\mathcal T\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Open set: member of the topology</li>\n<li>Metric spaces: open balls generate topology</li>\n<li>Closed: complement of open set</li>\n<li>Basis: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is basis if every open contains basis element around each point</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Willard, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in V$ 与 $U\\subseteq X$（see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]）","e